<description>&lt;p&gt;El Salvador has deployed more than 2,000 soldiers to Haiti to locate four missing Salvadoran personnel after a gang ambush near Port-au-Prince. Haitian gangs launched a major attack that killed 47 people, prompting condemnation from the UN chief. The Haitian government has postponed the presidential election to July 2027. The conflict produced 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxNaU16RlV4NUtmVGVTS0VWS0JFdkNPd0N0VmVEUU9RVGVLcHFJQ1UwZzQ0VWRKeXpXSlV3emhNM3R5NjVSZ05tNmRVOFJING5Kc25PRWhPS1ZUNGRmU01qcnhzbm9CSFJJWkFITUJjTDBaeVZvdV95VXJ1SGtDMmNfcFk0U3ByelJWSWFGQ2FZbksyZlk?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOMVRpYTJWOFVpTFFDSDhRaWRyOHQzSnFjNHlaYW45YmU3YmRCclpVcFU5c3VVTThlMjJOZUJjLTJkUF9NWnBBdlBHbDZZRmxXYldvTkw2cmR4OEZBQ19KMmc2YXJyUjdNT1ZwdG9rSVBubHo3S0FicXQwRWluemlpQzBBeDV2REtwSlUwXzI4Q2tmTzFfQnBHU19DVHZiVUpSaHhfRmZ3cl9POGRNOHB6TVk2U2Q?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE4xUElndFhkMXJUVDcta1JxYWdsbWlfSWUzX01FU255N3NEenRTSy1FblhNN1JlbzhJQ0YyS2JyMENDcjgzUTY5S0s5Y210X19HYW10QzZWOFFPZ3E1WUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPX3A0Z2dMclpLeWNSOTRfeVh3cXhTMWhnRnpwNEhnaXZXWl8tV3BKOFFZN25pWWtYS3NlNnRkd3FET0RhWlhPcFVNckQ1RW5sMldrRjQtMzY0ZDhJaXlDeDBsT1NsUF95NjFqRUFldXV2S055SjZkUjh1d2c2a3cwQjQwd1FEU1JNY1dXR3pwdUl1Uks0aWpUSXN6RFM0QzJ6VFBqb0F2YUhJa2ZfQ0ZOWHM0Mk5LckRv?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPN3N0enNCa0pOSjQzZ0ZL